          {
           "title": "UV Protection",
           "href": "/eyeglasses-contacts/eyeglasses/lens-treatments/uv-protection/",
           "summary": "The UV rays in sunlight can be harmful to the eyes. Lenses that block 100% UV help to ward off various eye conditions and damage.",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          },
          {
           "title": "Scratch Resistant",
           "href": "/eyeglasses-contacts/eyeglasses/lens-treatments/scratch-resistant/",
           "summary": "Scratches on lenses are distracting, plain and simple. And they can interfere with lens performance. Scratch-resistant treatments imbued into the lens surface toughen up the lenses making them more durable.",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          },
          {
           "title": "Anti-Reflective",
